    "The 26 alphabets reflect the essence of emptiness — where 2 + 6 = 8, symbolizing the mirror of zero, representing the unity of nature, life, and culture; zero reflects itself in the Absolute Void — where no measure, no number, no separation exists; nothing, yet everything latent; the numeral 0 is not a sign of nothingness but a symbol of perfect balance — the hidden seed of all expressions from 1 to 9; emptiness does not arise from zero; rather, it reflects the entire numerical cycle — the circumference of totality where all opposites dissolve and numbers fall into silence;", 
    
